# Trading Education Bot - environment variables
#
# This is an EDUCATIONAL paper-trading simulator. It never places real orders
# and requires NO exchange or broker API keys. There is intentionally nothing
# secret to configure here.
#
# The file exists only so future, non-secret options can be added without
# touching code. Copy it to ".env" if you want to experiment.
#
# Example (all optional, safe to leave commented out):
# TEB_DB_PATH=data/trading_bot.db
# TEB_LOG_LEVEL=INFO